ces primarily serve UO faculty, graduate students, and staff engaged in specified digital scholarship and pedagogy work.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"douglass-room-study-area","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Douglass Room Study Area","title":"Read beside the music collections","subtitle":"Douglass Room, Knight Library third floor","notes":"Use the open study area for reading or writing, then move to a listening carrel or workstation only if your project needs music and audio resources.","short_summary":"A natural-light study area within Knight Library's music and audio resource room.","evidence_claim":"The Douglass Room's open study area has natural light, comfortable seating, and abundant outlets; the room is open during all library hours.","source_url":"https://library.uoregon.edu/douglass-room","source_title":"Douglass Room | UO Libraries","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Open during all library hours; Audio Production Studios require completion of the room's online training tutorials.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
